1,Judging success from the wrong exit code,3,3,2026-09-02,1,2026-09-02,2026-09-02,"Read the script's own rc and its last output lines; append a real rc= to the log for long runs, and read that","exit 0 from a wrapper over a script that returned 1 or 2","flow.md SDLC stage 2 states it; run_checked.zsh when a suite is involved"
2,"Asserting a cause, then acting on it, without a disproof",3,1,2026-09-02,2,2026-08-29,2026-09-02,"Name the observation that would disprove the cause before acting on it; here ps -W | grep -c msys2 was one command away","a plausible story that shaped several turns of work, disproved later by a control","flow.md Plan: name the disproof first"
3,POSIX and Windows path forms compared directly,3,1,2026-09-02,3,2026-08-25,2026-09-02,"Normalize both sides to one form before comparing, and print the form the other tool uses in diagnostics","matched nothing, killed nothing, reported no work; the diagnostic showed the mismatch and was misread","test_scoop_install_verifies_the_install asserts to_windows_path is used"
4,Suppressing the error that was the answer,1,1,2026-09-02,1,2026-09-02,2026-09-02,"Never 2>/dev/null a diagnostic; suppress only where failure is expected and irrelevant","a command appeared to do nothing, with the reason discarded","mistakes.md #4; skill gate 3"
5,A filter that reports zero because it cannot match,2,1,2026-09-02,2,2026-08-27,2026-09-02,"Strip formatting before counting; prefer the tool's own summary line; cross-check a load-bearing count against a second signal","0 failures is exactly what a clean run looks like","flow.md SDLC stage 3"
6,A test pinned to a literal instead of the mechanism,2,1,2026-09-02,2,2026-08-29,2026-09-02,"Assert the markers of the mechanism, then confirm the loosened assertions still fail against the pre-fix version","LOUD, not silent: red because the code improved, and the red carries no information","flow.md Check: over-fitting paragraph"
7,Spawning a process per item on Windows,2,1,2026-09-02,2,2026-08-26,2026-09-02,"One pass building a table, then shell-array or case lookups; count the iterations before letting a loop spawn","reads as stuck rather than slow, because process creation cost turns it into a hang","msys2_fetch.sh header documents it"
8,Escaping for the wrong heredoc,1,1,2026-09-02,1,2026-09-02,2026-09-02,"Check which heredoc the line is in by reading the adjacent lines: if they use bare ""$@"", so should you","bash -n accepts both forms; the backslash would have shipped literally","adjacent code is the reference"
9,Reporting an outcome from the log instead of the system,1,1,2026-09-02,1,2026-09-02,2026-09-02,"Verify the end state: installed version against the one just packaged, and file hashes rather than version strings","the half that fails is the half nobody inspects; the release looked perfect","scoop_install.sh now exits 1 on either mismatch"
10,Pushing a branch that was not the one committed to,1,1,2026-08-26,1,2026-08-26,2026-08-26,"Push the branch you are on (git push ralic HEAD), or read the ref update line rather than the last word","Everything up-to-date is a success message for a no-op","read the ref update line"
